    "id": "vax11",
    "name": {
      "zh": "DEC VAX-11/780",
      "en": "DEC VAX-11/780"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "DEC VAX-11/780 是 1977 年发布的 32 位虚拟寻址小型机，以分页内存管理把虚拟内存推向主流，成为 VMS 与 BSD Unix 的重要平台，也是「VAX MIPS」性能基准的来源。",
      "en": "The DEC VAX-11/780, introduced in 1977, is a 32-bit virtual-addressing minicomputer that made virtual memory mainstream and defined the 'VAX MIPS' benchmark."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1977,
    "manufacturer": "Digital Equipment Corporation (DEC)",
    "category": "minicomputer",
    "description": "DEC VAX-11/780（1977），32 位虚拟寻址小型机：4 GB 虚拟地址空间、分页内存管理、VMS/BSD Unix 平台、≈1 VAX MIPS。",
